summary:
  A search result whose retry ladder has said its last word still counts as
  on its way to sound, for as long as its address stands.

history:
  The last word leaves the address standing, for the row's mark and the
  Playing page's star. With the address alone as the fact, the big button
  read Stop over a silent widget after every dead result, the desk's Play
  did nothing, and the radio took two presses to come back.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TransportLogic.js

find:
      return typeof address === "string" && address !== "" && !(typeof lastWord === "string" && lastWord !== "");

replace:
      return typeof address === "string" && address !== "";

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_transportlogic.qml::test_an_audition_is_on_its_way_from_its_click_until_its_ladder_has_spoken
  and tests/qml/tst_transportroads.qml::test_after_the_last_word_one_press_of_the_button_tries_the_result_again.
  Line-neutral.
